# Sample requests for local-api-check.
# Click "▶ Send Request" above a block to run it.

### Get a todo
GET https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/todos/1
Accept: application/json

### Create a post
POST https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test User",
  "body": "hello from local-api-check",
  "userId": 1
}
